#. <CLT 4>ボクは転げ落ちるように、
#. 階段を降りていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I practically leapt down the stairs, nearly losing my\n"
"balance.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、息を切らしながら
#. たどり着いた保健室で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I reached the nurse's office, completely out of\n"
"breath.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ッ！！
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは…自分の目を疑った…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I couldn't believe my eyes...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ついさっきまで…
#. そこにあったはずの山田クンの死体が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hifumi's body was there just a few minutes earlier.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 消えた……？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It just...disappeared?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 私と…セレスちゃん…
#. ちょっとトイレに行ってて…
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Me and Celeste went to the bathroom..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、目を離したのって…
#. ほんの１分くらいだけだよ…
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But we were only gone for like a minute!"
msgstr ""

#. それで…戻って来たら……
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "And then, when we got back..."
msgstr ""

#. おそらく…犯人の仕業でしょう…
#. 犯人が、<CLT 3>死体を持ち去った<CLT>のです…
msgctxt "0011 | CELES"
msgid ""
"This must be the work of the culprit. They must have\n"
"come and <CLT 3>carried the body away<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. まるで…楽しんでいるようですわね…
msgctxt "0012 | CELES"
msgid "They must really be enjoying this..."
msgstr ""

#. わたくし達が怯え、混乱するのを見て…
#. 楽しんでいるようですわ…
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Enjoying the sight of us standing around, frightened\n"
"and confused..."
msgstr ""

#. このままだと…全員殺されてしまいます。
msgctxt "0014 | CELES"
msgid "We're all going to die here."
msgstr ""

#. 彼らのように…殺されてしまいます…
msgctxt "0015 | CELES"
msgid "We're going to die, just like those guys died..."
msgstr ""

#. 信じられん…
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I don't believe this."
msgstr ""

#. 死体が消えたなど…信じられん。
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I don't believe a body would just...disappear."
msgstr ""

#. 立て続けに<CLT 3>２件もの殺人<CLT>があった上に、
#. さらには死体の消失まで…
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"First there were <CLT 3>two murders<CLT>, and now one of the\n"
"bodies has been taken?"
msgstr ""

#. …いくらなんでも不自然だ。
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "This is...unnatural."
msgstr ""

#. ちょ…ちょっと待って！
#. 立て続けに２件もの殺人って…どういう意味？
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "H-Hold on! What do you mean, TWO murders!?"
msgstr ""

#. 石丸も殺されていたのだ。
#. ３階の物理準備室でな…
msgctxt "0021 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Taka's been killed. We found him in the equipment\n"
"room."
msgstr ""

#. そんな…ッ！
#. い、石丸まで…！？
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I-It can't be! Taka, too!?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな…そんな事って……
msgctxt "0023 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It can't be... It can't be..."
msgstr ""

#. イヤァァァァアアアアアアアア！！
msgctxt "0024 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "NooooooOOOOOOO!!!"
msgstr ""

#. 落ち着くんだ、朝日奈ッ！
msgctxt "0025 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Hina, calm down!"
msgstr ""

#. このままじゃ…本当に殺されちゃうよ…
#. みんな…あいつに殺されちゃうよ…
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"We're all gonna die... All of us... They're gonna kill\n"
"all of us!"
msgstr ""

#. …だとしたら、次の標的は腐川あたりか？
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then who might the next target be? Toko?"
msgstr ""

#. えっ…？
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 忘れていた…！
#. あいつは物理準備室で気絶したままだ！
msgctxt "0029 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I completely forget! She's still unconscious in the\n"
"equipment room!"
msgstr ""

#. …現場に置いてきたのですか！？
msgctxt "0030 | CELES"
msgid "You left her at the scene of the crime!?"
msgstr ""

#. 仕方ないじゃないか。
#. 気を失ったまま起きやしないんだからな。
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We didn't have a choice. She passed out, and she\n"
"refused to wake up."
msgstr ""

#. 気を失ったまま…？
msgctxt "0032 | CELES"
msgid "So she is still unconscious?"
msgstr ""

#. 十神、お主は気付いていたのか？
#. ならば、なぜ…ッ！？
msgctxt "0033 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Wait, so you knew she was still up there, and said\n"
"nothing? Why...!?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺に付きまとう厄介者…
#. 殺されてくれた方がありがたい…
msgctxt "0034 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That annoying little insect that clings to me wherever\n"
"I go... We'd be better off without her."
msgstr ""

#. き、貴様…ッ！！
msgctxt "0035 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Y-You bastard!"
msgstr ""

#. おいおい、お前らだって忘れてたんだ。
#. 俺を責める権利なんてないはずだぞ。
msgctxt "0036 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Calm down. You forgot about her, didn't you? You have\n"
"no right to blame me."
msgstr ""

#. ケンカしてる場合じゃないよ！
#. それより早く戻ろうッ！！
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Everyone stop fighting! Right now we need to hurry\n"
"back!"
msgstr ""

#. もう…これ以上人が死ぬのはイヤだよ…
msgctxt "0038 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I can't take this anymore... I don't want anyone else\n"
"to die!"
msgstr ""

#. 十神よ、もし腐川に何かあったら…
#. 我は貴様を許さぬぞ…！！
msgctxt "0039 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Byakuya... If something's happened to Toko, I'll never\n"
"forgive you!"
msgstr ""

#. フッ…
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr ""
